type: dataset
title: "Unlevered and levered U.S. equity REIT return indices"
abstract: >-
  Quarterly unlevered (asset-level) and levered (equity) total-return indices for U.S.
  equity REITs, 1993Q1-2025Q4: all equity REITs, core and non-core property types, and 14
  property types, value- and equal-weighted, following the de-levering method of Ling and
  Naranjo (2015).
